        "The first time a gatewalker (including any PC) attempts to Strike a Guest or target it with a spell, a repressed memory from their Missing Moment surfaces. For a brief instant, the character recalls facing down a much larger and fully formed saumen kar, one with four horns and glowing runes on its fur. This memory of the character's first encounter with Ainamuuren evokes waves of fear and shame. The character must make a successful DC 25 Will save or become frightened 1 (frightened 2 on a critical failure), after which the character is immune to Trigger Memory."
